OL,3,ANorth Korean hackers used fake video
OL,4,Acalls in $400m crypto hack, says FBI
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The North Korean regime relies on
OL,7,Fproceeds from large-scale
OL,8,Fcryptocurrency theft to fund its
OL,9,Fillicit weapons program, stealing
OL,10,Fbillions of dollars in recent years,"
OL,11,Fsays FBI cyber director Brett
OL,12,FLeatherman.
OL,14,FThis comes a week after the world's
OL,15,Flargest crypto exchange Binance
OL,16,Frevealed that hackers had used fake job
OL,17,Finterviews to steal a record $6.3bn
OL,18,F(#4.7bn) from the company.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
